I understand ammunition to be what is used by a launcher.
Sling/rock, bow/arrow, crossbow/bolt.  YANI - atlatall will
throw javelins but then they have a chance of disappearing.

> Darts disappear. Daggers don't. Are darts "ammunition"?
> And, if so, why aren't daggers?

Darts and shuriken are missiles that disappear.  Daggers, knives,
spears are missiles that don't.

The best I can come up with on what's ammunition vs missile
vs melee weapon is the monster strategy in the code.  Monsters
start out zapping, firing and throwing as soon as they get in
range, then switch to polearm at 2, then to melee at 1.  The
weapons they throw are the best I can come up with as missiles.
Missiles are a subset of ammunition.

If multifire happens with daggers, why not knives?  Some decision
by the DevTeam, maybe to keep healers from having a practical
multifire option.



